WEBVTT

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:31.225
Let's restructure these subsidies
to demand better water efficiency

00:12:31.249 --> 00:12:32.971
and less pollution.

00:12:32.995 --> 00:12:38.105
(Applause)

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.199
Finally:

00:12:40.223 --> 00:12:41.695
we can't expect progress

00:12:41.719 --> 00:12:44.597
if we're unwilling to confront
the conflicts of interest

00:12:44.621 --> 00:12:46.478
that suppress science,

00:12:46.502 --> 00:12:48.450
that undermine innovation

00:12:48.474 --> 00:12:50.932
and that discourage transparency.

00:12:50.956 --> 00:12:52.756
It is in the public interest

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:56.728
to measure and to share everything
we can learn and discover

00:12:56.752 --> 00:12:59.341
about the risks we face in water.

00:12:59.881 --> 00:13:03.451
Reality does not exist
until it's measured.